{
  "openapi": "3.0.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "Agent-Service",
    "description": "> 本文档定义后端 (Backend) 与 Agent Service 之间的全部 HTTP 接口。\n> 基础 URL: `http://agent-service:8002`\n> 无需鉴权（内网 RPC 调用）。\n> Agent 强制使用 Pydantic Structured Output 保证返回严格 JSON。\n\n---",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "tags": [],
  "paths": {
    "/agent/v1/chat": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "智能辅导对话",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "\n| 字段 | 类型 | 必填 | 来源 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|------|------|\n| `user_id` | string | Y | 后端 JWT 解析 | 用户唯一标识，Agent 用它在 Qdrant 中检索该用户的长期记忆 |\n| `message` | string | Y | 前端用户输入 | 当前这一轮的用户消息 |\n| `user_profile` | object | Y | 后端从 SQL 查出 | 完整 6 维画像 JSON |\n| `user_profile.modality_preference` | object | Y | SQL | 各模态百分比，影响回答中的示例类型偏好 |\n| `user_profile.guidance_level` | string | Y | SQL | `\"L1\"` 启发点拨 / `\"L2\"` 伴学拆解 / `\"L3\"` 保姆生成 |\n| `user_profile.knowledge_coordinates` | object | Y | SQL | `mastered`: 已掌握知识点列表; `learning`: 正在学习的 |\n| `user_profile.cognitive_blind_spots` | array[string] | Y | SQL | 用户易错/薄弱的知识点列表 |\n| `user_profile.drive_intent` | string | Y | SQL | `\"daily\"` 日常学习 / `\"exam_cram\"` 考前突击 |\n| `user_profile.discipline_base` | string | Y | SQL | `\"bronze\"` / `\"silver\"` / `\"gold\"` 整体水平分档 |\n| `recent_history` | array[object] | Y | 后端从 SQL 查最近 N 轮 | 每项含 `role`(\"user\"/\"assistant\") 和 `content` |\n| `global_summary` | string | Y | 后端从 SQL 查 | 全局历史压缩摘要 |",
        "tags": [],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "user_id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "message": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "user_profile": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "modality_preference": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "video": {
                            "type": "integer"
                          },
                          "chart": {
                            "type": "integer"
                          },
                          "text": {
                            "type": "integer"
                          },
                          "code": {
                            "type": "integer"
                          },
                          "formula": {
                            "type": "integer"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "video",
                          "chart",
                          "text",
                          "code",
                          "formula"
                        ]
                      },
                      "guidance_level": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "knowledge_coordinates": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "mastered": {
                            "type": "array",
                            "items": {
                              "type": "string"
                            }
                          },
                          "learning": {
                            "type": "array",
                            "items": {
                              "type": "string"
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "mastered",
                          "learning"
                        ]
                      },
                      "cognitive_blind_spots": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "drive_intent": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "discipline_base": {
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "modality_preference",
                      "guidance_level",
                      "knowledge_coordinates",
                      "cognitive_blind_spots",
                      "drive_intent",
                      "discipline_base"
                    ]
                  },
                  "recent_history": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "role": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "content": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "role",
                        "content"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "global_summary": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "user_id",
                  "message",
                  "user_profile",
                  "recent_history",
                  "global_summary"
                ]
              },
              "example": {
                "user_id": "u_123",
                "message": "递归的终止条件怎么理解？",
                "user_profile": {
                  "modality_preference": {
                    "video": 30,
                    "chart": 25,
                    "text": 15,
                    "code": 20,
                    "formula": 10
                  },
                  "guidance_level": "L2",
                  "knowledge_coordinates": {
                    "mastered": [
                      "顺序表",
                      "链表"
                    ],
                    "learning": [
                      "二叉树遍历"
                    ]
                  },
                  "cognitive_blind_spots": [
                    "递归边界条件",
                    "指针越界"
                  ],
                  "drive_intent": "daily",
                  "discipline_base": "bronze"
                },
                "recent_history": [
                  {
                    "role": "user",
                    "content": "什么是二叉树？"
                  },
                  {
                    "role": "assistant",
                    "content": "二叉树是一种树形结构..."
                  }
                ],
                "global_summary": "用户是个初学者，正在学数据结构，偏好图表解释。"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {}
                },
                "example": "event: message\ndata: {\"type\": \"status\", \"content\": \"正在检索知识库...\"}\n\nevent: message\ndata: {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"递归的终止条件是指\"}\n\nevent: message\ndata: {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"函数停止调用自身的判断...\"}\n\nevent: message\ndata: {\"type\": \"tool_call\", \"tool_name\": \"draw_diagram\", \"tool_args\": {\"type\": \"mermaid\", \"code\": \"graph TD; A-->B; A-->C;\"}}\n\nevent: message\ndata: {\"type\": \"profile_update_suggestion\", \"content\": {\"cognitive_blind_spots_removed\": [\"递归边界条件\"]}}\n\nevent: done\ndata: {\"status\": \"finished\"}"
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": []
      }
    },
    "/agent/v1/memory/compress": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "记忆压缩与事实提取",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "| 字段 | 类型 | 必填 | 来源 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|------|------|\n| `user_id` | string | Y | 后端 | Agent 用它在 Qdrant 中按 user_id 分区存储提取的 facts |\n| `old_summary` | string | Y | 后端从 SQL 查 `user_summary.summary` | 上一次压缩后的全局摘要 |\n| `recent_dialogues` | array[object] | Y | 后端从 SQL 查最早的 10 轮 | 待压缩的原始对话列表 |\n",
        "tags": [],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "user_id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "old_summary": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "recent_dialogues": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "role": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "content": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "role",
                        "content"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "user_id",
                  "old_summary",
                  "recent_dialogues"
                ]
              },
              "example": {
                "user_id": "u_123",
                "old_summary": "用户是个初学者，正在学C语言。",
                "recent_dialogues": [
                  {
                    "role": "user",
                    "content": "指针太难了，总是段错误"
                  },
                  {
                    "role": "assistant",
                    "content": "段错误通常是因为访问了未分配的内存地址..."
                  },
                  {
                    "role": "user",
                    "content": "那怎么调试呢？"
                  },
                  {
                    "role": "assistant",
                    "content": "推荐使用 valgrind 工具..."
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "new_summary": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "extracted_facts": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "new_summary",
                    "extracted_facts"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "new_summary": "用户是个初学者，正在学C语言。目前在学习指针，经常遇到段错误，对内存地址概念模糊，偏好图解方式理解。",
                  "extracted_facts": [
                    "卡点：指针段错误",
                    "偏好：需要图解内存",
                    "工具：已推荐 valgrind"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": []
      }
    },
    "/agent/v1/assessment/evaluate": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "测验评估与画像更新",
        "deprecated": false,
        "description": "| 字段 | 类型 | 必填 | 来源 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|------|------|\n| `user_id` | string | Y | 后端 | 用户标识 |\n| `current_profile` | object | Y | 后端从 SQL 查 | 当前画像的部分字段（Agent 需要参考来调整建议） |\n| `current_mastery` | object | Y | 后端从 SQL 查 | 各知识点当前掌握度 `{\"kp_id\": 0.0~1.0}` |\n| `quiz_data.knowledge_point_id` | string | Y | 后端 | 本次测验对应的知识点 ID |\n| `quiz_data.knowledge_point_name` | string | Y | 后端 | 知识点中文名 |\n| `quiz_data.questions` | array | Y | 后端从 SQL 查题目 | 题目列表，含 `correct_answer` |\n| `quiz_data.user_answers` | object | Y | 前端提交 | 用户的答案 `{\"q_id\": \"选项\"}` |",
        "tags": [],
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "user_id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "current_profile": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "guidance_level": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "cognitive_blind_spots": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "guidance_level",
                      "cognitive_blind_spots"
                    ]
                  },
                  "current_mastery": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "additionalProperties": {
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    "properties": {}
                  },
                  "quiz_data": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "knowledge_point_id": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "knowledge_point_name": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "questions": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "properties": {
                            "id": {
                              "type": "string"
                            },
                            "question": {
                              "type": "string"
                            },
                            "options": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "properties": {
                                "A": {
                                  "type": "string"
                                },
                                "B": {
                                  "type": "string"
                                },
                                "C": {
                                  "type": "string"
                                }
                              },
                              "required": [
                                "A",
                                "B",
                                "C"
                              ]
                            },
                            "correct_answer": {
                              "type": "string"
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "id",
                            "question",
                            "options",
                            "correct_answer"
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "user_answers": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "additionalProperties": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "properties": {}
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "knowledge_point_id",
                      "knowledge_point_name",
                      "questions",
                      "user_answers"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "user_id",
                  "current_profile",
                  "current_mastery",
                  "quiz_data"
                ]
              },
              "example": {
                "user_id": "u_123",
                "current_profile": {
                  "guidance_level": "L2",
                  "cognitive_blind_spots": [
                    "指针越界"
                  ]
                },
                "current_mastery": {
                  "kp_binary_tree": 0.5,
                  "kp_recursion": 0.3
                },
                "quiz_data": {
                  "knowledge_point_id": "kp_traversal",
                  "knowledge_point_name": "二叉树遍历",
                  "questions": [
                    {
                      "id": "q1",
                      "question": "前序遍历的顺序是？",
                      "options": {
                        "A": "根左右",
                        "B": "左根右",
                        "C": "左右根"
                      },
                      "correct_answer": "A"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "q2",
                      "question": "递归遍历的终止条件是？",
                      "options": {
                        "A": "节点为空",
                        "B": "节点为叶子",
                        "C": "深度超限"
                      },
                      "correct_answer": "A"
                    }
                  ],
                  "user_answers": {
                    "q1": "A",
                    "q2": "C"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "score": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "evaluation_text": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "updated_profile_patch": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "guidance_level": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "cognitive_blind_spots": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "items": {
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "guidance_level",
                        "cognitive_blind_spots"
                      ]
                    },
                    "updated_mastery_patch": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": {
                        "type": "number"
                      },
                      "properties": {}
                    },
                    "recommended_next_nodes": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "kp_id": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "name": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "reason": {
                            "type": "string"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "score",
                    "evaluation_text",
                    "updated_profile_patch",
                    "updated_mastery_patch",
                    "recommended_next_nodes"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "score": 50,
                  "evaluation_text": "你对前序遍历掌握得很好，但对递归终止条件理解有误。递归遍历在节点为空时应停止，而非节点为叶子时。",
                  "updated_profile_patch": {
                    "guidance_level": "L2",
                    "cognitive_blind_spots": [
                      "指针越界",
                      "递归终止条件"
                    ]
                  },
                  "updated_mastery_patch": {
                    "kp_traversal": 0.5,
                    "kp_recursion": 0.2
                  },
                  "recommended_next_nodes": [
                    {
                      "kp_id": "kp_recursion",
                      "name": "递归",
                      "reason": "递归终止条件掌握不足"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {}
          }
        },
        "security": []
      }
    },
    "/agent/v1/resource/generate": {
